---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Washy washy — disclaimer"
  description="This chart is unofficial and community-run, reflecting one household's own settings — not a manufacturer's guarantee."
>
  <h1 class="mb-6 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-4xl">Disclaimer</h1>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-base text-body">
    <p>
      Washy washy is an unofficial, community-run project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
      by, or produced in cooperation with any washing machine or appliance manufacturer.
    </p>
    <p>
      The bundled chart reflects one household's own washing and ironing settings — a set of
      choices that worked for one washer, one iron and one person's clothes. It is not a
      manufacturer's guarantee, a care-labelling standard, or professional advice. Loads, fabrics
      and machines vary, and a setting that's safe on one machine can damage another.
    </p>
    <p>
      A garment's own care label always takes precedence over anything shown here. When the two
      disagree, follow the label.
    </p>
    <p>
      As stated in the project's licence (GPL-3.0-or-later, sections 15–16): the software is
      provided "as is," without warranty of any kind, express or implied. Washy washy's
      maintainers are not liable for any damage — to clothes, machines, or anything else — arising
      from its use.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
